Z||000003||Coconut||06-18-2000||11:49 PM||||What's up Ozz,<BR>Glad to see ya made your trip safe & sound. GTgirl & me went out to Copalis over the weekend and man, the weather was sweet! Anyway, good to see you back online and Best of Luck landing that job! <P>Keep on Cruisin'<BR>Coconut||||reg||1
